<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid;BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt;PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt;HEIGHT: 14.2pt;BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0;BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm" rowspan="2" width="46%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify;TEXT-INDENT: 14.4pt"><span>Talabgorlar tomonidan subsidiya olish uchun taqdim qilinadigan hujjatlarni oʻrganib chiqadi.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify;TEXT-INDENT: 14.4pt"><span>Normativ-huquqiy hujjatlarda belgilangan talablarga muvofiq ariza boʻyicha xulosani tasdiqlaydi va vakolatli organga taqdim etadi.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid;BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt;PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt;HEIGHT: 14.2pt;BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0;BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="1%">
