<p align="center"><span>Vakolatli davlat organlari</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid;BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt;PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt;HEIGHT: 14.2pt;BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0;BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="1%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: center" align="center"><s></s></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid;BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt;PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt;HEIGHT: 14.2pt;BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0;BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm" rowspan="2" width="46%">
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify;TEXT-INDENT: 14.4pt"><span>Vakolatli davlat organlarining hududiy, tuman (shahar), ishchi guruhlari aʼzolari tomonidan taqdim etilgan xulosalarni jamlaydi, tahlil qiladi va amaldagi normativ-huquqiy hujjatlar talablariga muvofiqligi boʻyicha koʻrib chiqadi.</span></p>
<p style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify;TEXT-INDENT: 14.4pt"><span>Koʻrib chiqish natijasiga koʻra arizani subsidiya turiga qarab amaldagi normativ-huquqiy hujjatga asosan moliyalashtirish boʻyicha yakuniy xulosa beradi.</span></p></td>
<td style="BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid;BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0;PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm;PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt;PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt;HEIGHT: 14.2pt;BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0;BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid;PADDING-TOP: 0cm" width="1%">
