le="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">20.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:69%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-indent:15.25pt;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Qoraqalpogʻiston Respublikasi sovitkichli sigʻimlar uyushmasiga aʼzo subyektlarga, ishga tushirilgan sovitkichli sigʻimlarni qurish va jihozlash xarajatlarining bir qismini qoplash.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:27%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Agrosanoatni rivojlantirish agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">21.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:69%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-indent:15.25pt;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Qoraqalpogʻiston Respublikasi sovitkichli sigʻimlar uyushmasiga aʼzo subyektlarga, ishga tushirgan sovitkichli sigʻimlarning qish va bahor oylarida elektr energiyasi isteʼmoli xarajatlarining bir qismini qoplash.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:27%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Agrosanoatni rivojlantirish agentligi</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">22.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:69%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p style="text-indent:15.25pt;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Chorvachilik xoʻjaliklariga xorijiy davlatlardan import qilingan nasldor qoramol, qoʻy va echkilar uchun subsidiya ajratish</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:27%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:11px"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Qishloq xoʻjaligi vazirligi huzuridagi Veterinariya va chorvachilikni rivojlantirish qoʻmitasi</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="-7869491" id="-7869491">Izoh. Mazkur roʻyxatda koʻrsatilgan subsidiya turlariga qishloq xoʻjaligi mahsulotlarini yetishtirish jarayoniga subsidiya ajratish tartibi bilan bogʻliq normativ-huquqiy hujjatlar qabul qilinishi bilan qoʻshimcha kiritib boriladi.</div></div><div class="CHANGES_ORIGINS"><label id="s1104"></label><div name="-7869495" id="-7869495">(2-ilova Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2025-yil 24-noyabrdagi 740-sonli <a href="https://lex.uz/ru/docs/-7856451?ONDATE=26.11.2025 00#-7859982">qarori </a>tahririda — Qonunchilik maʼlumotlari milliy bazasi, 26.11.2025-y., 09/25/740/1090-son)</div></div><div class="PUBLICATION_ORIGIN"><label id="s1089"></label><div name="-6315959" id="-6315959">(Qonunchilik maʼlumotlari milliy bazasi, 19.12.2022-y., 09/22/711/1096; 03.08.2023-y., 07/23/257/0552-son; 04.08.2023-y., 09/23/330/0559-son; 30.11.2023-y., 09/23/632/0910-son; 29.01.2024-y., 09/24/52/0073-son; 23.04.2025-y., 09/25/255/0376-son; 26.11.2025-y., 09/25/740/1090-son; 15.07.2026-y., 09/26/381/0734-son)</div></div></div>
